  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_1651.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Onda ha sido este s&aacute;bado capital de la escalada, con el I Open del Club Desplome, en el pabell&oacute;n municipal, y del balonmano sobre hierba, en el campo municipal de l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic, con la celebraci&oacute;n del VII Torneig Handbol Herba.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_1683.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El torneo de balonmano era para las ategor&iacute;as benjam&iacute;n y alev&iacute;n, organizado por el &nbsp;Club Amics Handbol d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1651.jpg\" alt=\"img_1651\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1652.jpg\" alt=\"img_1652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1653.jpg\" alt=\"img_1653\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1654.jpg\" alt=\"img_1654\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1655.jpg\" alt=\"img_1655\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1656.jpg\" alt=\"img_1656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1657.jpg\" alt=\"img_1657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openescaladaonda13/img_1658.jpg\" alt=\"img_1658\" style